# The Artificer core (WP-A1: artifice/*.js, design/data/artifice.toml, the mithril bridge in economy/recipes.js).
# `ttl artifice expect`, `ttl roads expect` and `ttl rep expect` print "ttl: ..." when wrong, which `server.sh test-all`
# counts as a failure. A refused player action answers "Workshop: ..." (not a failure); refusals are asserted with the
# try_* fields instead. A is a Life 2 soul on a platform far from every NPC (a Workshop Bench and a Bone Altar beside it);
# B stays in Life 1. Bots never claim the server's first-metal chronicle (TtlArtifice.isBot).
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] artifice: N Smithing Bench products can carry a maker's stamp" (N > 0) at the recipe reload,
# "[ttl] artifice: TtlBotArtA delivered patrol_blades: 30 bronze, +5 points", "... took artifice.engrave dark ...",
# "... stole tensura:..._schematic from the Dwargon smithy", and no "[ttl] artifice command failed".
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArtA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotArtB
@sleep 3
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA reset
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtB reset
ttl roads test TtlBotArtA reset
ttl guild reset TtlBotArtA
ttl rep set TtlBotArtA dwargon 0
ttl rep set TtlBotArtA tempest 0
ttl rep set TtlBotArtA holy_church 0
clear TtlBotArtA
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA life2
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtB life1
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 4090 4090 4110 4110
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 4094 150 4094 4106 150 4106 minecraft:stone
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 4094 151 4094 4106 154 4106 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotArtA 4100 151 4100
execute in minecraft:overworld run setblock 4102 151 4100 ttl:workshop_bench
execute in minecraft:overworld run setblock 4098 151 4100 ttl:bone_altar
@sleep 1
# 0. What the reload registered: the Workshop Bench recipe, the two mithril kiln recipes, the Smithing Bench products.
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA recipe_ttl.workshop_bench yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA recipe_ttl.irons_mithril_melting yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA recipe_ttl.irons_mithril_mixing yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA smith_products yes
# 1. The charter: Life 2 only, three schematics (learned or carried), at a Workshop Bench.
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtB try_charter life2only
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA rank 0
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_take_patrol_blades needs the artificer charter (/ttl artifice charter at a Workshop Bench)
give TtlBotArtA tensura:iron_gear_schematic
give TtlBotArtA tensura:long_sword_schematic
give TtlBotArtA tensura:spear_schematic
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_charter ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice charter
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA rank 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA title Journeyman
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA stage_rank1 yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA has_ttl.artificer_charter 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA constructs 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_charter already chartered
clear TtlBotArtA
# 2. Made at the Smithing Bench (the bench code path): stamped, 1 craft point + 3 for this soul's first low magisteel.
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA craft tensura:low_magisteel_long_sword
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA stamped 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA made_by mine
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA metal_low_magisteel yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA points 4
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA craft 1
# 3. A commission (tier 1, made_by): delivered for 3 silver, Tempest +2, 5 points; once a day.
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_take_kurobe_katana needs rank 2 (Artisan)
ttl artifice commission test TtlBotArtA patrol_blades
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA jobs 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA ready_patrol_blades yes
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice commission turnin
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA jobs 0
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA done_patrol_blades yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA last_coins 30
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA points 9
ttl rep expect TtlBotArtA tempest value 2
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_take_patrol_blades already done today
# made_by: an item the soul did not make does not count until it carries its stamp.
ttl artifice commission test TtlBotArtA garm_plate
# Into the main hand (the stamp and the chisel act on it): `give` lands in the first free slot, which after the patrol
# blades' turn-in is not the selected one.
item replace entity TtlBotArtA weapon.mainhand with tensura:low_magisteel_chestplate
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA ready_garm_plate no
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA made_by none
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA stamp
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA ready_garm_plate yes
# 4. Rank 2 (40 points): the Engraving Chisel (a workshop recipe), then an engraving on the soul's own work.
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_make_engraving_chisel needs rank 2 (Artisan)
ttl artifice points TtlBotArtA set 40
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA rank 2
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA title Artisan
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA stage_rank2 yes
give TtlBotArtA tensura:pure_magisteel_ingot
give TtlBotArtA irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_make_engraving_chisel ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice make engraving_chisel
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA has_ttl.engraving_chisel 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA unlocked_engraving_chisel yes
give TtlBotArtA tensura:low_quality_magic_crystal 2
give TtlBotArtA tensura:silver_coin 5
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_engrave_tensura.magic_weapon Magic Weapon needs rank 3
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_engrave_tensura.sturdy ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice engrave tensura:sturdy
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA enchant_tensura.sturdy 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA has_tensura.low_quality_magic_crystal 0
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA points 42
ttl roads expect TtlBotArtA count_artifice.engrave.grey 1
# The engraved plate is still the soul's own work: deliver it (Dwargon +2, 5 points).
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice commission turnin
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA done_garm_plate yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA points 47
# The turn-in's coins may land in the emptied main-hand slot: empty it for the next check.
item replace entity TtlBotArtA weapon.mainhand with minecraft:air
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_engrave_tensura.swift hold the item to engrave in your main hand
# 5. The dark road: a Cursed Whetstone made at the Bone Altar curses any blade at once and pays the five costs.
item replace entity TtlBotArtA weapon.mainhand with tensura:low_magisteel_sword
give TtlBotArtA ttl:soul_ash
give TtlBotArtA irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_make_cursed_whetstone ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice make cursed_whetstone
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA has_ttl.cursed_whetstone 1
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_curse ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice curse
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA cursed yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA has_ttl.cursed_whetstone 0
ttl roads expect TtlBotArtA count_artifice.engrave.dark 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotArtA chaos2 3
ttl rep expect TtlBotArtA holy_church value -3
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_curse needs a Cursed Whetstone
# 6. Stolen schematics: only in the Dwargon smithy at night (test hook `anywhere`: no place/night rule, 2 s channel).
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_steal only inside the Dwargon smithy
# From a neutral 0 (the garm plate paid Dwargon +2 above).
ttl rep set TtlBotArtA dwargon 0
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA anywhere
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_steal ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice steal
@sleep 4
ttl rep expect TtlBotArtA dwargon value -20
ttl roads expect TtlBotArtA count_artifice.schematic.dark 1
ttl roads expect TtlBotArtA chaos2 6
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_steal the smithy is still on guard (24 h)
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA strict
# The honest road: buy one (20 gold, Dwargon friendly), Dwargon +2.
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_buy dwargon must be friendly
ttl rep set TtlBotArtA dwargon 30
give TtlBotArtA tensura:gold_coin 20
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA try_buy ok
execute as TtlBotArtA run ttl artifice schematic buy
ttl roads expect TtlBotArtA count_artifice.schematic.good 1
ttl rep expect TtlBotArtA dwargon value 32
# 7. Grand Artificer needs 500 points AND a craft unique or Dwargon exalted; the rank never skips that.
ttl artifice points TtlBotArtA set 500
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA rank 3
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA title Master Artificer
ttl rep set TtlBotArtA dwargon 90
ttl artifice refresh TtlBotArtA
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA rank 4
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA stage_rank4 yes
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA constructs 4
ttl artifice expect TtlBotArtA muster 6
# Cleanup.
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA reset
ttl artifice test TtlBotArtA strict
execute in minecraft:overworld run setblock 4102 151 4100 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run setblock 4098 151 4100 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 4090 4090 4110 4110
ttlbot remove TtlBotArtA
ttlbot remove TtlBotArtB
